  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You sever a druid, ranger, or nature-aligned spellcaster's connection to natural magic. The target must make a Constitution save. On failure, they cannot cast spells from the Druid or Ranger spell list, use Wild Shape, or communicate with animals or plants for 1 minute. This effect is not magical silence &mdash; it is a disruption of the channel. Counterspell cannot end it.</p>",
